B.Xq=new A.iM("How do I book a venue?","To book a venue, browse through our listings, select your preferred venue, choose your event date and time, and complete the booking process by making a payment. You'll receive a confirmation email with your booking details.")
B.Xw=new A.iM("What payment methods do you accept?","We accept various payment methods including credit/debit cards (Visa, Mastercard), GCash, Maya, and bank transfers. All payments are processed securely through our platform.")
B.Xx=new A.iM("Can I cancel or modify my booking?","Yes, you can cancel or modify your booking depending on the venue's cancellation policy. Most venues allow free cancellation up to 24-48 hours before the event. Go to My Events to manage your bookings.")
B.Xt=new A.iM("How do refunds work?","Refunds are processed based on the venue's cancellation policy. If you cancel within the free cancellation period, you'll receive a full refund. Refunds typically take 5-7 business days to process.")
B.Xr=new A.iM("What happens if the venue cancels?","If a venue cancels your booking, you'll receive a full refund plus a credit for a future booking. Our support team will help you find an alternative venue if needed.")
B.Xv=new A.iM("How do I become a host?","To become a host, go to Profile > Switch to hosting > List your place. You'll need to provide venue details, photos, pricing, and availability. Our team will review your listing before it goes live.")
B.Xu=new A.iM("Are there any fees for hosts?","Venu charges a small service fee on each booking (typically 3-5%). There are no upfront costs to list your venue. You keep the majority of your earnings.")
B.Xz=new A.iM("How do I contact support?","You can reach our support team through the Help Center in the app, or email us at support@venu.ph. We typically respond within 24 hours.")
B.Xy=new A.iM("Is my personal information secure?","Yes, we take data security seriously. Your personal information is encrypted and stored securely. We never share your data with third parties without your consent.")
B.Xs=new A.iM("What is the Service Guarantee?","Our Service Guarantee ensures that if there's an issue with your booking that's covered by our policies, we'll work to make it right. This includes rebooking assistance and refunds for qualifying issues.")
